h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">Pi Mark â€” <span class="text-euro-600">Transportable Pressure Equipment</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The Transportable Pressure Equipment Directive 2010/35/EU (TPED) addresses the safety requirements and the conformity assessment procedure for transportable pressure equipment used exclusively for the transport of dangerous goods (Class 2) within the Union. Transportable pressure equipment is required to bear the Pi marking to indicate compliance with the directive.</p><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/40"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-truck text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Additional Compliance Requirements</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Companies seeking to export transportable pressure equipment to the European market must comply with TPED as well as the agreements and regulations concerning international carriage of dangerous goods by road (ADR), by rail (RID), and by inland waterways (ADN).</p></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-eurogold-100 bg-eurogold-50/30"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-award text-white text-xs"></i></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed"><strong>Eurocert</strong> is an authorized inspection and testing body for the European Agreement Concerning the International Carriage of Dangerous Goods by road.</p></div></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 h-[320px] md:h-[420px] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1784009485/pi_pkrjk4.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="PI Mark Certification"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/20 via-transparent to-transparent"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_left,rgba(212,168,67,0.05)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Scope of Coverage</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Products Covered Under TPED</h2></div><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-10"><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg><p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">High-pressure gas cylinders</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg><p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">LPG cylinders</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(